          "id": "ed74db39c620ae65098504a55f4fec4fd877d3c6",
          "message": "chore(deps): update @iconify-icons packages to v2 (#1184)\n\nBumps @iconify-icons/heroicons-outline, heroicons-solid and tabler from\nv1 to v2 (supersedes #1140, #1141, #1142 as a single lockfile-consistent\nchange).\n\nThe v2 major is a packaging change only: the packages gained an `exports`\nmap and moved icon data to `data/<letter>/<icon>.js`. Verified all 81\n`@iconify-icons/*` deep imports in the repo still resolve and that every\nicon payload is byte-identical to v1 — no visual change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
